Third-party code in this repository keeps its own license:
- src/xmp/   libxmp-lite, MIT (src/xmp/LICENSE)
- src/mp3/   minimp3, CC0 (src/mp3/LICENSE)
- src/midi/  TinySoundFont, MIT (src/midi/LICENSE)
- src/codecs/ dr_wav, dr_flac: public domain or MIT-0 (src/codecs/LICENSE.dr_libs);
              stb_vorbis: MIT or public domain (end of stb_vorbis.c);
              miniz (tinfl): MIT (src/codecs/LICENSE.miniz)
- src/gme/   Game_Music_Emu, GNU LGPL 2.1 or later (src/gme/LICENSE), with
             emu2413, MIT (src/gme/ext/LICENSE.emu2413). MusicPlayer.bin
             includes it: its source and the build files are in this
             repository, so the binary can be rebuilt with a modified version.
- src/app/mp_font.c   font8x8 by Daniel Hepper, public domain
- sdk/       Retro-Go SD core / homebrew SDK, MIT (sdk/LICENSE.MIT)
